  "title": "Carrot Pecan Crunch Pie",
  "description": "Like a classic pumpkin pie, but this lovely, light pie is made with pureed carrots. The custard is poured into a pie shell, sprinkled with pecans and baked. Serve with whipped cream flavored with candied ginger.",
  "authors": [
    "Mary Wood"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-11-22T14:30:59-05:00",
